{'symbol': 'IVZ', 'date': '2022-03-25 16:10:00', 'title': 'INVESCO ADVISERS, INC. ANNOUNCES INCREASE IN MONTHLY DISTRIBUTION FOR INVESCO SENIOR INCOME TRUST', 'text': 'ATLANTA , MARCH 25, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0INVESCO ADVISERS, INC., A SUBSIDIARY OF INVESCO LTD. (NYSE: IVZ), ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE BOARD OF TRUSTEES (THE "BOARD") OF INVESCO SENIOR INCOME TRUST (NYSE: VVR) (THE "FUND") APPROVED AN INCREASE IN THE MONTHLY DISTRIBUTION AMOUNT PAYABLE TO COMMON SHAREHOLDERS PURSUANT TO THE FUND\'S MANAGED DISTRIBUTION PLAN (THE "PLAN").'}